    "steam_appid": 2989390,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989390/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1717383034\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Welcome to Puzzle Garden, your very own virtual farm! Relax, turn up the music, and immerse yourself in the casual world of farming and puzzle-solving.<br><br>Puzzle Garden features 8 casual puzzles for you to play through. Each one is hand-crafted to have you strategizing and planning to make the most amount of money before the end of the season. Try and collect all 24 stars!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989390/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1717383034\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore: Dive into unique garden layouts with distinct challenges, and discover the optimal layout that balances beauty and bounty!<br></li><li>Strategize: Maximize your profits by using each plot of land to its fullest potential!<br></li><li>Plant Fun Crops: Utilize each crop's unique ability to earn all 3 stars per level!<br></li><li>Make Beautiful Gardens: Enjoy the fruits (or vegetables) of your labor and see your garden fully realized!<br></li><li>Relax: Chill out to a custom soundtrack and simple visuals to unwind after a long day.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989390/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1717383034\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989390/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1717383034\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Welcome to Puzzle Garden, your very own virtual farm! Relax, turn up the music, and immerse yourself in the casual world of farming and puzzle-solving.<br><br>Puzzle Garden features 8 casual puzzles for you to play through. Each one is hand-crafted to have you strategizing and planning to make the most amount of money before the end of the season. Try and collect all 24 stars!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989390/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1717383034\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore: Dive into unique garden layouts with distinct challenges, and discover the optimal layout that balances beauty and bounty!<br></li><li>Strategize: Maximize your profits by using each plot of land to its fullest potential!<br></li><li>Plant Fun Crops: Utilize each crop's unique ability to earn all 3 stars per level!<br></li><li>Make Beautiful Gardens: Enjoy the fruits (or vegetables) of your labor and see your garden fully realized!<br></li><li>Relax: Chill out to a custom soundtrack and simple visuals to unwind after a long day.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989390/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1717383034\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
